#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/legal-information.rst:24
msgid "Disclaimer"
msgstr "Penafian"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/legal-information.rst:26
msgid ""
"The CMUcam4 was designed very carefully. We have made every effort to avoid "
"mistakes but we cannot guarantee that the CMUcam4 is free of errors. The "
"information found on this website is given as an indication. The technical "
"characteristics of the CMUcam4 may change at any time without notice in "
"order to improve the quality and the functionality of the CMUcam4."
msgstr ""
"CMUcam4 dirancang dengan sangat hati-hati. Kami telah melakukan segala upaya"
" untuk menghindari kesalahan tetapi kami tidak dapat menjamin bahwa CMUcam4 "
"bebas dari kesalahan. Informasi yang ditemukan di situs web ini diberikan "
"sebagai indikasi. Karakteristik teknis CMUcam4 dapat berubah sewaktu-waktu "
"tanpa pemberitahuan untuk meningkatkan kualitas dan fungsionalitas CMUcam4."

